    },
    {
      "actionDate": "2025-06-12",
      "text": "On passage Passed by the Yeas and Nays: 321 - 104 (Roll no. 166). (text: 6/11/2025 CR H2625-2627)",
      "type": "Floor",
      "actionCode": "H37100",
      "sourceSystem": "House floor actions"
    },
    {
      "actionDate": "2025-06-12",
      "text": "Passed/agreed to in House: On passage Passed by the Yeas and Nays: 321 - 104 (Roll no. 166). (text: 6/11/2025 CR H2625-2627)",
      "type": "Floor",
      "actionCode": "8000",
      "sourceSystem": "Library of Congress"
    },
    {
      "actionDate": "2025-06-12",
      "text": "Considered as unfinished business. (consideration: CR H2806)",
      "type": "Floor",
      "actionCode": "H30000",
      "sourceSystem": "House floor actions"
    },
    {
      "actionDate": "2025-06-11",
      "text": "POSTPONED PROCEEDINGS - At the conclusion of debate on S. 331, the Chair put the question on passage of the bill and by voice vote, announced that the ayes had prevailed. Mr. Pallone demanded the yeas and nays and the Chair postponed further proceedings until a time to be announced.",
      "type": "Floor",
      "actionCode": "H8D000",
      "sourceSystem": "House floor actions"
    },
    {
      "actionDate": "2025-06-11",
      "text": "The previous question was ordered pursuant to the rule.",
      "type": "Floor",
      "actionCode": "H35000",
      "sourceSystem": "House floor actions"
    },
    {
      "actionDate": "2025-06-11",
      "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with one hour of debate on S. 331.",
      "type": "Floor",
      "actionCode": "H8D000",
      "sourceSystem": "House floor actions"
    },
    {
      "actionDate": "2025-06-11",
      "text": "Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 884, H.R. 2056, H.R. 2096 and S. 331. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 884, H.R. 2056, H.R. 2096, and S. 331 under a closed rule with one hour of general debate for each bill. The resolution provides for one motion to recommit on H.R. 884, H.R. 2056, and H.R. 2096, and one motion to commit on S. 331.",
      "type": "Floor",
      "actionCode": "H8D000",
      "sourceSystem": "House floor actions"
    },
    {
      "actionDate": "2025-06-11",
      "text": "Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 489. (consideration: CR H2625-2633)",
      "type": "Floor",
      "actionCode": "H30000",
      "sourceSystem": "House floor actions"
    },
    {
      "actionDate": "2025-06-10",
      "text": "Rule H. Res. 489 passed House.",
      "type": "Floor",
      "actionCode": "H1L220",
      "sourceSystem": "House floor actions"
    },
    {
      "actionDate": "2025-06-09",
      "text": "Rules Committee Resolution H. Res. 489 Reported to House. Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 884, H.R. 2056, H.R. 2096 and S. 331. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 884, H.R. 2056, H.R. 2096, and S. 331 under a closed rule with one hour of general debate for each bill. The resolution provides for one motion to recommit on H.R. 884, H.R. 2056, and H.R. 2096, and one motion to commit on S. 331.",
      "type": "Floor",
      "actionCode": "H1L210",
      "sourceSystem": "House floor actions"
    },
